hed job to the existing owning receipt ledger. Corrections append. Before full snapshots/installations measure free space; below20GiB allocate no extra full copy. At most3 expensive checkout/snapshot jobs across this goal. Preserve unique source/refs/locks/evidence and prior failures.\n\n## Risks\n\nStale/revoked authority, unknown dimensions or mapping, duplicate/conflicting state, incomplete readback and confusing source proof with served consumption remain explicit refusals.\n\nLicense: GPL-3.0-or-later."}, :causal/root "63d8441a-ef85-4a02-a4c6-6eaf59528145"}
