{:event/type "kanban.comment", :event/id "kanban-deliver-outcome-attributed-once-only-graph-feedback-27c12a0c-4b32-4264-bc80-a5edbe957283", :event/time "2026-10-15T02:42:48.114Z", :session/id "kanban", :delivery/mode "tell", :payload {:task-id "deliver-outcome-attributed-once-only-graph-feedback", :text "Verified planning correction from review5527377626: Classify artifact and destination evidence audiences separately from the maker's access. Private/restricted artifact bytes, paths/media identity, destination account/record IDs/URLs and their association may be inspected only through an authorized protected seam outside Git/public logs. Retain full restricted matching proof only in protected private storage or inspect transiently. Committed/reviewer/public evidence may retain only an explicitly audience-authorized digest/redacted binding to that protected proof; identifiers or hashes are not presumed safe merely because the maker may read them. No credentials, raw private artifact/message content or unapproved identifiers enter receipts/events/resources/logs. Positive private-destination/artifact fixtures must prove actual protected matching and no forbidden retained disclosure; public outcomes retain their authorized independent readback. If protected verification or safe evidence is unavailable, refuse outcome proof and reinforcement. No publication replay.", :source "cli", :agent "eta-mu", :write-id "1792032168112-0.cz2a1yrh2u7mljc8f7a", :type "comment"}, :causal/root "92ce21d9-e0da-4841-9369-3c76cafde95c"}
